# CR 615 through an effect card (EffectEffect.java): Haze Frog's ETB
# trigger puts an effect in its controller's Command zone carrying "prevent
# all combat damage that other creatures would deal this turn". The
# replacement is active from the Command zone, so Grizzly Bears' unblocked
# attack deals nothing. At cleanup the effect ends and leaves the game
# (GameAction.changeZone drops an exiled effect card outright).
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 2 G
tapformana human 3 G
tapformana human 4 G
tapformana human 5 G
tapformana human 6 G
queue paygeneric G
queue paygeneric G
queue paygeneric G
castspell human 1
resolvestack
advance 2
queue attackers 7
declareattackers
advance
queue blocks none
declareblockers
advance
advance
combatdamage
advance 4
